Pipeline

I want this to be a straight forward way to get the frozen phonons for the penacene system.

1. Convert frequency outcar from VASP to .csv files (VASP_FREQ_OUTCAR_to_csv)
2. (csv_to_inputs)
    - Iterate through each .csv and do phonon displacement based on ZG code.
    - Folder Layout
        -zg_modified
            -XX_freq
                - SCF
                - VASP
                - .txt

    - Each has a fractional coordinate version and a cartesian coordinate (angstrom) version
